window.products.push({"id":830181,"name":"BCOZZY Pillow Bundle- 2 Travel Neck Pillows for Adults with Double Support- for Comfortable Sleep on The Plane. Large Size, Navy, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F3uPQjcoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE SUPPORT TO THE HEAD, NECK, AND CHIN - The Patented BCOZZY pillow is the only pillow that provides doubled support which helps relax and prevent neck pain and sore shoulders when sleeping sitting upright in an airplane, car, or at home 3 ERGONOMIC WAYS WITH DOUBLE SUPPORT – You can adjust the BCOZZY ergonomic pillow to your desired sleeping position and get maximum comfort. FRONT- Place the overlapping pillow arms under the chin for double chin support. SIDE - If you are a side-sleeper, fold the pillow in half, place it on the shoulder, and lean your head to the side. FRONT+ SIDE - If your head falls to the front and the side, slide the overlapping arms 90 degrees to the side and get double support to the neck and chin. PERFECT BALANCE BETWEEN SOFTNESS AND FIRMNESS - Breathable fabric shell, made of cozy microfleece and cool microsuede, and filled with soft BOUNCE BACK down alternative, provide adequate comfort for the neck and head and will shape to your favorite position. IS YOUR HEAD BEING PUSHED FORWARD USING U-SHAPE TRAVEL PILLOWS? While most travel pillows are bulky in the back, pushing the head forward and causing neck pain and muscle strain, our neck pillow has a FLAT-BACK design that prevents the head from being pushed forward. EASY TO CARRY- The carry bag is easy to attach to a suitcase or a backpack. Available in two sizes for adults, Large size for neck size up to 16” and X-Large size for neck size 16” and more, the BCOZZY travel pillow is one of the most favorite travel accessories and travel gifts. FULLY MACHINE WASHABLE- Unlike memory foam travel pillows that are not machine washable; our travel pillow design makes life as easy as counting sheep! Just pop it in the washer and let it air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F3uPQjcoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BCOZZY","source_asin":"B0B5XSFZ5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5XSFZ5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5XSFZ5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
