window.products.push({"id":830315,"name":"P&P CHEF Navy Blue Farmhouse Bread Box for Kitchen Counter, Large Metal Bread Storage Container to Hold 2+ Loaves, High Side & 3 Handles for Indoor Fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JwSPy1+WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About P&P CHEF Blue Bread Storage Bin P&P CHEF metal bread box is made of healthy powder-coated iron. Bread bin with lid provides extra large capacity to ensure enough space to store food such as bread, tortillas, bagels, buns, rolls, cookies, donuts, chips, pastries, and others. 13.1” X 7.2” X 11.81” Perfect size for any countertop or pantry shelf. The lid allows enough air for maximum freshness. Classic blue bread container match any stylish kitchen. SPECIFICATION: Material: Powder-coated steel Color: Blue Dimensions:  Overall (included lid): 13.1” X 7.2” X 11.81” Breadbox: 13.1” X 7.2”X 9.6” Height of the lid: 1.5” Why Choose P&P CHEF Breadbox : 1.Effortless clean: Smooth coating surface just needs to wipe it gently, saving lots of time and energy. 2.Keep kitchen tidy: Extra large capacity keep your kitchen organized and tidy, Make larger room for the kitchen. 3.Easy to carry: Light weight and carrying handles help to move the bread bin and carry out such as Weekend picnics easily. 4.Fitting cover: Fitting cover ensures enough air for ventilation to keep food fresh and prevents dust into food to ensure the clean. 5.Classic color: It is suitable for any style kitchen such as farmhouse or modern kitchen. Using instruction 1.It is suggested washing by hand with soft cloth for avoiding scratching surface. 2.For the durability, it is suggested wiping it with hands after cleaning instead of air drying. 3.For clean and sanitation, it is suggested wrapping the food with fresh-keeping bag before putting the food in a breadbox.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JwSPy1+WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P&P CHEF","source_asin":"B0943WB61F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0943WB61F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0943WB61F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":830316,"name":"Holiday Poinsettia Tapestry Furniture Protector Cover, Recliner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715sJ+Eyd4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Holiday Poinsettia Tapestry Furniture Protector Cover Description Now you can add beautiful seasonal color and give your furniture an instant makeover with this tapestry style cover. The crisp white background features bright red poinsettias surrounded by holly leaves and berries. The colorful cover protects your furniture from spills, stains, pets and more. Machine wash. Polyester and cotton; imported. Sizes available to fit a Chair, a Recliner, a Loveseat or a Sofa. Material Type: Polyester Pattern: Christmas, Holiday, Poinsettias About Collections Etc’s Furniture Protector Covers Give any living room an instant makeover simply by covering an old couch with a stylish throw or cover. Our furniture covers can also be used to prevent tears, rips, stains or hair buildup from pets or standard everyday use. Shop our selection of reversible furniture covers and themed furniture covers and enjoy a new look in your home for less. Our ready-made furniture covers and slipcovers for your sofa and chairs are one of a kind. If you want to change the look of your furniture, why spend a fortune on a new piece when you can purchase one of our stylish furniture covers at a reasonable cost. No Risk Purchase, Hassle-Free Returns - 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed With customer satisfaction as our number one priority, we proudly offer a Satisfaction Guarantee for all of our merchandise and services. From our appealing merchandise and incredible values, to our friendly customer service, we strive to provide a positive shopping experience by meeting or exceeding your expectations.If you are not completely satisfied within 60 days of your purchase (see return policy for details).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715sJ+Eyd4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Collections Etc","source_asin":"B01LWASOBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWASOBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWASOBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
