window.products.push({"id":830339,"name":"CANOPUS Shoe Slots Organizer, Adjustable Shoe Stackers, 12-pack: 6 Gray and 6 Pink, Made in Europe, Adjustable Slots to Double-up Closet Space, Double","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wn5kDk74L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MADE IN EUROPE, GREAT AND LONG-LASTING QUALITY: These shoe slots are made of very sturdy material to ensure long durability and to save you money. The shoe stackers also have 4 adjustable heights, ranging from 2.7'', 4.3'',6.4'' to 7.2''. This makes it very convenient to make adjustments according to the type of shoes so that they are not squeezed and damaged. They are suitable for any children's shoes, sneakers, slippers, flat shoes, sandals, high heels, etc… DOUBLE UP YOUR SPACE: Thanks to these shoe stackers, you can easily make use of twice the same area under your bed, in your cabinet, or your closet. Your shelf space will increase by another 100% instantly! Moreover, you will not have any more trouble looking for the matching shoe when leaving home, even when in a hurry. Your shoes can now be easily organized in pairs within your closet, no matter if they are high heels or sneakers. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: Our product has an elegant look and design, and is made in Europe, with great quality material. The nice gray and pink colors will spice up your closet and will help you distinguish between the types of shoes that had been used for. The side grips and flaps together with the textured surface provide your shoes stay put on the top slot and protect them from being squeezed and scratched so that your space remains clean, tidy, and nice-looking at the same time. VERY USER-FRIENDLY AND PRACTICAL: The shoe stackers can easily be cleaned and disinfected with soap and water and can be used for a much longer time. You can organize all types of shoes, boots, sneakers in no time either in your cabinet or on your shoe racks. Your shelves now look more attractive than ever. 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: At Canopus, we strive for absolute customer satisfaction. If you are not satisfied with our product in any way, we commit to refund your money back, with no question asked. Thanks in advance for choosing and enjoying our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wn5kDk74L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANOPUS","source_asin":"B08J4BZPMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J4BZPMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J4BZPMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":830340,"name":"Nivons Vuneks 12\" Full + 2 Free Pillows, Gel-Infused Memory Foam Mattress in a Box, Integrated Tencel Powder Into Cellpur Foam, Oeko-Tex 100 Certified","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uWFHiXECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 FREE Gel-Infused Memory Foam Pillows (160$) value are included with the mattress. CELLPUR FOAM: CELLPUR reaches new heights when it comes to breathable, durable, resilient, hygiene and comfort. For the first time, Tencel powder with its sensational climate properties, has been successfully integrated into foam. This boosts the foamâ€s moisture absorption potential. GEL-INFUSED MEMORY FOAM: Memory Foam was first developed for space technologies in order to relieve astronauts from the intense G-Forces they experienced during space travel. Our bedding materials have a unique open cell structure which responds to a bodyâ€s weight and temperature.These materials are also known as memory foam mattresses since they contain memory cells that minimize the effects of surface pressure on the body during sleep. By molding to your body, the mattress alleviates pressure and paves the way for healthier blood circulation. Reduces unwanted movements in bed and increases the quality of sleep. COVER: Made of Certificated Self-Clean Soladel fabric which is a sunlight activated technology and it is also an organic pollutant buster. Revolutionary Titanic Microsphere technology harnesses sunlight to break down organic dirt molecules. Works similar to photosynthesis by being a regenerative photocatalyst. Only top cover is machine washable at 86F. 100 NIGHT HOME TRIAL: All Nivons mattresses include a 100-night in-home trial backed by a no-hassle, full refund policy, plus an honest 10-year limited warranty you can actually use. NOTE: Please allow up to 72 hours for the mattress to fully expand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uWFHiXECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nivons","source_asin":"B07RLV9MB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RLV9MB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RLV9MB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
