window.products.push({"id":830362,"name":"Astronaut Snow Globes for Kids,80MM Musical Glitter Snow Globe to Take Children to Explore The Vast Starry Sky, Astronaut Toys Birthday Gifts for Boys","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kLoM9u1dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dreamy space snow globes sparkle and spin,and snowflakes magically fly when shaken. The TNOIE brand team is dedicated to making snow globes that little girls love.We have a variety of snow globe music boxes for you to choose from,such as mermaid,unicorn,angel,princess,astronaut,etc.I believe there must be a style you like. Clear Glass Ball:In our music box,a brave astronaut travels through space in a spaceship.When the lights and snowflakes fall,the base also rotates,and it makes you feel like you are in the vast galaxy. Sturdy and Durable Base:The snow globe base is made of high-grade resin,we have added rockets,ripples and other patterns to make the base more delicate and realistic. Battery Powered:There is a snow globe switch under the base.Just flip the switch to start the snow globe.The operation is simple and convenient.The music box requires 3 AAA batteries (included).Just tap the desktop to wake up the music box. Astronaut Snowglobes are cool gifts for boys, girls, granddaughters, girlfriends, kids, friends, birthdays, weddings, holidays and anniversaries. Music box can be used to decorate your room, believe it can add different colors to your room. Snow Globe Size:5.9*5.9*7 inches,large size,suitable as a decorative gift Color:blue,purple Function:colorful lights + multiple lights and music + automatic snow + sound control Power:3 AAA batteries Prevention: 1.The function of our music box is controlled by a switch,music and lighting are inseparable. 2.The sphere of the snow globe is made of glass,which has better texture and clarity than plastic,but glass is fragile,so be careful when placing it. 3.Since the snow globe is filled with water,too low temperature may cause the water to freeze and crack.If the snow globe you received is damaged or unsatisfactory,please contact us and we will provide you with a 100% satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kLoM9u1dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TNOIE","source_asin":"B09Q5CGN2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q5CGN2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q5CGN2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
