window.products.push({"id":830526,"name":"Cold Brew Coffee Maker by Zen Brews | Make Low Acidity - High Caffeine Cold Brew Coffee at Home | 32oz Glass Carafe w/Stainless Steel Filter + Extra G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1X7JWkzczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make your own custom cold brews with our elite brewing carafe, designed to deliver maximum flavor, elegant serving, and cost-effective coffee drinking. It also brews delicious loose-leaf teas! A PROFESSIONAL BREW FROM THE COMFORT OF YOUR OWN HOME Are you over-spending on expensive cold brews? Is your home coffee machine no longer satisfying? With the at-home cold brew coffee carafe, you can harness the delicious flavor of your favorite coffee beans while customizing your ideal drink. Naturally enjoy the full-bodied taste of cold brew, which boasts 1.5x more caffeine and significantly lower acidity than hot brew. SUPERIOR BREWING, LASTING QUALITY Other cold brew makers use flimsy plastic mesh filters that break easily, but our BPA-free stainless filter and glass design delivers maximum durability and robust flavor. Enjoy batch after batch of tasty cold brew, iced teas, fruit-infused water, or hot loose-leaf tea. Make your own dark roast chocolate almond coffee with coconut milk, or brew a batch of lavender mint tea for a refreshing treat!  Reusable stainless steel filter/infusing basket Tall, slim design fits compactly in your fridge 34-ounce capacity yields 4 to 5 cups Dishwasher safe for easy cleaning Heat safe and refrigerator safe Use it to make cold brew, loose-leaf tea, or infused waters YOU DON’T HAVE TO BE A PROFESSIONAL BARISTA Whether you’re stocking up for tomorrow morning or sharing a batch of cold brew with friends, the Zen Brews carafe is easy to use and produces perfect drinks every time. Simply place your desired amount of coffee grounds in the stainless steel brewing basket to control the intensity of your drink, then let sit 18-24 hours and enjoy! Sleek packaging and elite product design make this brewing carafe perfect for gifting. Pick up your own cold brew maker today and enjoy the rich flavor of large-batch home brewing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1X7JWkzczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zen Brews","source_asin":"B01L4SOK4I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L4SOK4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L4SOK4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
