window.products.push({"id":830655,"name":"6 x 8 oz Easter Bread parchment baking paper Molds 'Butterflies'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DDurKs9DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"6 pcs. 8 oz Easter Bread parchment baking paper Molds Elegant paper bakeware from Ukraine in Butterflies pattern. Shipped from Pikesville, MD. Fine food-grade free-standing disposable paper baking pans are good for Easter bread, Panettone, Cake, Brioche, Kulich, cupcakes, jumbo muffins, bread baking and any variety of projects in between. Perfect for home-baked gifts and commercial bakeries. Our molds eliminate the need for metal baking pans, cutting down on costly and time consuming cleanup, and allowing you to bake as many or as few items as you like. Made of food-safe rigid baking paper, these molds are oven safe up to 390 degrees Fahrenheit (200 degrees Celsius), freezer safe and microwave safe. Note the molds are not recommended for liquid use, as the manufacturing process leaves a number of pinprick holes on the bottom of the cup that liquid may seep through. Use these molds for a thicker substance like dough or batter. They are perfect for presenting your cakes to friends or for holding your cakes ready on the table for your guests to enjoy. Materials: sides - calendared paper with micro-perforation, bottom - micro-flute corrugated paper, with micro-perforation. Size: 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" (90 x 85 mm) diameter x height. Baking weight: 8 oz (230 g).Set of 6 pcs. with different design (see photos).Disposable bakeware is recyclable but not compostable. Make sure to scroll over to view ALL photos. Please see and use all pictures for the very best description, and thanks for looking!Please note that current listing shows stock photos, actual color and shape may vary slightly. Made in Ukraine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DDurKs9DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodya","source_asin":"B07NBXGY4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NBXGY4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NBXGY4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":830656,"name":"Crystal Allies Materials: 1lb Bulk Tumbled Petrified Wood Fossils from South Africa - Large 1\" Polished Natural Crystals for Reiki Crystal Healing *Wh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518WUKekZ5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Petrified Wood is an ideal stone for individuals who are constantly fluctuate between emotions, concentration levels, and anxiety based fear. The stone practices patience, and offers a slow and steady growth for a person to achieve a spiritual transformation. By stabilizing one's emotions, Petrified Wood ensures calm in those who may be experiencing fear. It offers feelings of safety and security to assist those who are going through processes of change. Petrified Wood also has a connection to time, as it ensures us that we are moving forward in a steady way, neither too fast or too slow or in combat with the days' hours. Just as the circles on a tree trunk represent its age, petrified wood assists in recalling past life instances, gaining insight, and making connections from these memories. It aids in combating limitations that may have been handed down through ancestors and helps you avoid repetitive mistakes. Being a gradual stone, Petrified Wood ensures one will reach their goal if they trust in the process. Petrified Wood dates back to more than 225 years ago, when columns of the wood were scattered across the desert. The trees were uprooted by great floods or flows of lava, and washed down from the highlands only to be buried by silt and volcanic ash. Overtime, wind and rain unearthed the wood, and the petrification became visible. Petrified wood can be used in a variety of healing forms. It is particularly useful to protect joints and to provide strength and relief from inflammation. A decorative piece of Petrified Wood can also be used in one's work environment to release power from trees and rocks to assist throughout the work day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518WUKekZ5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystal Allies","source_asin":"B009JPPME6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009JPPME6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009JPPME6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
