window.products.push({"id":830740,"name":"Magnetic Spice Rack Organizer 2 Pack Spice Magnet Shelf Seasoning Mounted Spice Racks With 4 Hooks for Cabinet Refrigerator Space Saving Kitchen Organ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UEZFBmguL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【High-quality And Durable】2 Pack magnetic spice racks with 4 hooks are made of high-quality alloy steel materials and super strong magnets on the back. Black magnetic seasoning organizer for the refrigerator can well keep your kitchen tidy and serve you for a long time. ✅【Reinforced Magnetism And Save Space】Reinforce the magnetism behind the spice rack, so don't worry about falling off. It has the strength to hold up to 6.6 lbs of storage weight. You can place many spice jars and bottles on the shelf which saves space in your kitchen. ✅【Large Capacity And Easy Installation】Each seasoning rack can hold up to 8 regular-size 4 oz spice jars. 4 Pcs magnetic shelves can meet the organization of all the seasonings at home. No tool to install, just stick the magnetic spice holder to the fridge or other metal surfaces. ✅【Versatile Application】Kitchen spice rack can store spice, seasoning bottles, jars, and some daily necessities, medicines, etc. Also apply for microwaves, coffee makers, washing machines, doors, and other iron surfaces, magnet refrigerator rack create more space in a cluttered kitchen. ✅【Kitchen Safety And Flexibility】The spice rack have 1.7-inch guardrails to keep spice, seasoning bottle, and jars from falling which help you ensure the safety of the kitchen. Innovative use of strong magnet backing, change the magnetic fridge shelf as needed placement. ✅【Worry-free Shopping】Professional magnetic spice rack organizer manufacturing experience ensures reliable quality and professional customer service. If there is any problem after purchase, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UEZFBmguL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOANDO","source_asin":"B0BNZZG8M9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNZZG8M9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNZZG8M9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":830741,"name":"Hyacinth Forcing Clear Vase, for Indoor Forcing, No Bulbs (3 Vases)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uY7BYUsOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Daikon RadishHyacinth BulbHow to Force Hyacinths To force hyacinths on water, set a bulb just above — but not touching — the water in a forcing vase or other container. Put it in a dark, cold area to root for 8-16 weeks. This could be an unheated mudroom, attic, or garage a cold-frame or possibly your refrigerator, though many refrigerators are too cold for optimal forcing. The temperature during this rooting period is critical: 40° to 48° F is ideal. Avoid freezing temperatures. The best way to monitor the temperature is to use a maximum-minimum thermometer available from any good garden center.If the water gets murky, change it. When roots fill the glass and there’s an inch or two of top-growth, bring it into subdued light and warmer but still cool temperatures (about 60° F again, a max-min thermometer will make this easy). After 7-10 days, move it into bright light, but keep it as cool as you can and avoid direct sunlight. Turn it every day to keep it growing upright.If your hyacinth spikes start to bloom while much too short, that usually means they didn’t get enough rooting time at 48° and below — which is essential for them to develop the gibberellic acid which allows bloom stalks to lengthen. (This is Mother Nature’s clever mechanism for keeping hyacinths and other bulbs from sending up their bloom stalks during mid-winter thaws.)Note - some people, particularly those with sensitive skin, have an itchy or tingly reaction to handling hyacinth bulbs. If you are unsure, the safest way route is to wear gloves while planting your bulbs.Track Page Views WithAuctiva's FREE Counter Feedback From Buyer Date/time good seller o**********1 ( 547 ) 2017-09-2107:57:43 Nice item promptly shipped. b******2 ( 1247 ) 2017-09-2104:35:13 A+++++++ SELLER, SUPER FAST SHIPPING t******4 ( 663 ) 2017-09-2103:10:40 Everything is ok! 2******k ( 502 ) 2017 Exported By ExportYourStore","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uY7BYUsOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CaribbeanGarden","source_asin":"B082BG9TQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082BG9TQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082BG9TQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
