window.products.push({"id":830852,"name":"RNK Shops Butterflies Plastic Kids Mug (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LzYr9IYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is the perfect starter cup for a toddler who is ready to graduate from a sippy cup. This mug is not like other plastic mugs. Being made of a specially formulated polymer, this mug is seemingly indestructible and extremely durable. This mug will withstand a numerous amount of drops, spills, and maybe even a few temper tantrums.At 11oz, the mug is not too big for a toddler to hold, but not too small to where they don't complain about it still being a \"baby cup.\" This BPA free cup is both dishwasher and microwave safe!Now just personalize it! There are a large variety of adorable kid's designs to choose from on our website to get your child excited to use a \"grown up\" cup.This cup goes great with our melamine plates and bowls. They make a great dinner set. Get a cute bib from our nursery section and a snack container from our kitchen section as well! Personalize everything for your little one!Design Shown: Butterflies (#44559)Features:==================================== * [Exceptional Durability]: Specially formulated polymer makes the mug virtually indestructible. * [Perfect Size]: 11 oz. capacity, ideal for toddlers transitioning from sippy cups. * [Vibrant Customization]: Full color wrap around print to excite and engage your child. * [Safe and Convenient]: BPA free, dishwasher safe, and microwave safe for easy use and cleaning.Care Instructions:==================================== * Dishwasher Safe * Microwave Safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LzYr9IYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B0764KR22Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0764KR22Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0764KR22Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":830853,"name":"Handheld Pressurized Steam Cleaner with 11-Piece Accessory Set, Multi-Surface Steamer for Cleaning, All Natural Steam Cleaner for Car, Home, Floor, Up","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SeMAwTeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful Steamer for Cleaning】The high-pressure steam with 3BAR equivalent to 3KG of pressure can spray 3.9ft(1.2m), so our steam cleaner is more than enough to blow away oil, dust and stains. 【Hot Steamer for Cleaning】Our 1050 watts steamer for cleaning can heat up fast in 3-5 minutes. The steam cleaner for car can continuously emit pressurized 230℉(115℃) hot steam for up to 8-12 minutes! You can use MOSCHE steam cleaner for car to cut through any grease, grout and tile. 【Multiple Surface Steam Cleaner】Our handheld pressurized steam cleaner is best suited for hard to reach areas, windows, floor gap, grout and tile, fabric & sofa material, kids toy, sinks, stoves, BBQ grill, toilet, shower curtains, car seats & rims, wallpaper and more. 【11 Accessories Set Steam Cleaner】Our powerful steam cleaner for car includes an exclusive free 11 pieces accessory kit. This all in one steamer for cleaning includes 3 Nylon Brush and other attachments.You can choose the accessories you need to clean your hard to reach areas. 【All Natural & Chemical Free Steam Cleaner】The safe and reliable steam cleaners for home use naturally using only water without chemical so it do nothing harmful. Pretty safe for the family who with kids and pets at home. 【Portable & Handheld Steamer for Cleaning】 This handheld design make our steam cleaner easily to carry from room to room. 9.4ft(2.86m) cord also allows for greater flexibility when cleaning your house anywhere. 【Tips】If you can not open the cap after use, that is because the temperature of the residual steam indide the tank is still too high. Please: 1.Unplug first 2. Fully discharge the residual steam or wait the steam cool down. 3. Open the lid and add water into the steam cleaner. 【Tips 2】Please wait the first heating completely finish to use the steam cleaner. Because it can spray steam when it is not sufficiently heating, but it will be mixed with water when using. After a short time use, it is normal that the steam cleaner can not heat because the internal temperature is reach to 138 ℃, at this time the temperature control will be protected. If there is no temperature control and infinite heating, the machine will burn internal components because of high temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SeMAwTeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOSCHE","source_asin":"B07ZGFQTTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZGFQTTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZGFQTTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
