window.products.push({"id":830857,"name":"Infirleo Glass Drafting Table with Stool, Height Adjustable Drawing Table Art Table for Adults/Artists, 75° Tilting Multifunctional Painting Table Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-pMc51FgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌟〖Upgraded Glass Drafting Table 〗The old version's angle of the toptable angle is 0-45°, our new version of the toptable is upgraded to 0-75°, the use of more comprehensive functions. The 16-levels buckle is updated from the original manual operation to an automatic buckle. The adjustable height of the tabletop ranges from 25.2''-35.8\". 🌟〖 100% Solid And Stable 〗Founded on a powder-coated steel frame in a black finish, this drawing table features a tempered glass tabletop and a CARB-Certified MDF side countertop. The thickness of steel frame is from 0.8mm Upgrade to 1.2mm. It's heavier, safer and more stable for you and your family. 🌟〖 Sufficient Storage Space 〗This glass art table features a host of compartments, trays and hanging drawers underneath for holding all of your paints, pens, and other equipment. on the left is an additional countertop for laptop, charts, etc. 🌟〖 Anti-slip & Anti-scratch 〗Crafted with 4 adjustable Anti-vibration feet pad, adapting to uneven ground. Together with extra large rubber footpads not only prevent scratching floors while moving the table, also ensure a supremely stable work platform,effectively prevent slipping. 🌟〖 Multifunctional Drawing Desk 〗The main workstation can be adjusted up according to your need. You can not only do your painting, drawing or drafting on it but also can be served as a normal computer office desk or study desk for daily use. 🌟〖 Dimensions & Services 〗Desk size: 38.5\"L x 23.6\"W x 25.2\"-35.8\"H; Stool size: 15.3\"L x 15.3\"W x19.7\"H; Sub board size: 23.6\"L x 11.8\"W. If you have any questions about the art table, please feel free to contact us. Half year warranty, feel confident to buy it. We are always here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-pMc51FgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Infirleo","source_asin":"B09YHHTLR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YHHTLR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YHHTLR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":830858,"name":"Chef Knife - inch Kitchen Knife, German High Carbon Stainless Steel Sharp Knife, Professional Meat Knife with Ergonomic Handle and Gift Box for Family","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ceLOrocuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-carbon stainless steel blade-It is manufactured from high-quality stainless steel that maintains its functionality for a long time. And to boost its sturdiness, the steel contains 0.6-0.75 carbon. This makes it two times as hard as other knives in its class as they contain about 0.3% carbon Multi-functional knife-The NIUTA knife is classified and designed to be multipurpose knife for professional applications .It cuts,dices,slices,chops and also cuts meat off bones. It comes with a HRC( Rockwell Hardness Scale) of 56-58 which makes it among the tough knives in its class Ergonomic pakka handle- To make it more professional and minimize any fatigue, finger numbness or aches after holding it continuously for an extended time the knife's handle is made from Pakka. This is material that originates from Africa and its known for its comfort, strength and stability Ultra-sharp edge- Sharpness is key to achieving the best cuts and this is evident in the knife's blade which is quite sharp and will remain this way even after tough tasks such as cutting tough meat or removing flesh from bones. The sharpness is further boosted by use of the latest German engineering Corrosion and anti-tarnish blade- In addition to carbon, 16-18% chrome is also included in the blade's metal composition. This gives its a glossy finish which will not fade or tarnish even after using it for a long time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ceLOrocuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIUTA","source_asin":"B09M84ZMF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M84ZMF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M84ZMF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
