window.products.push({"id":830933,"name":"Chime or Spell Candles (4\"): Set of 12 Color Candles - by Govinda®","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fl5eM9t4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This item contains: Twelve (12) different colored chime or spell candles. Each candle measures approximately 4 inches tall and 0.5 inches in diameter. This mini unscented candle pack is perfect for your rituals, prayers, blessings, or to warm up any ambiance and work with the power of colors. Never leave a burning candle unattended. Keep out of the reach of children.Multipurpose Uses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fl5eM9t4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Govinda","source_asin":"B00O9GYS1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O9GYS1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O9GYS1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":830934,"name":"Core Home Chip and Dip Bowl, Lime","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XQuejtwLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our spun Chip and Dip bowls are fun and festive way to serve your favorite salty snack and savory dip. Our removable dip bowl nests neatly inside the chip bowl and removes easily for a convenient, no-mess refill of your dip. What is spun bamboo? Spun bamboo is the result of a process for spinning bamboo that is done by local artisans in the villages in Vietnam, not in a factory setting. Each piece is completely unique. Colors are then applied by using a water-based, food-safe, organic dyes. The grainy finish allows the pop-of-color for your table, but allows the beauty of the bamboo wood to shine through. Each bowl is unique and beautiful… your only issue will be choosing which spectacular color you like more Core Bamboo is committed to creating superior products, while taking care of the people who create them, and the environment that provides the resources. Bamboo is one of the most remarkable resources available, regenerating itself every 4 years. This fact, along with understanding bamboo is stronger than maple and lighter than oak, and has naturally antiseptic properties, makes bamboo the perfect choice for wood products for the home. All bamboo used by Core Bamboo is 100-Percent organically grown, with vibrant colors achieved using food-safe, water-based adhesives and natural oils. Each product meets FDA and European Food Safety guidelines. Exceptional products and a belief in ethical and social responsibility; it is no wonder Core Home continues to win honors and awards by its peers, while customers order Core products again and again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XQuejtwLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Core Home","source_asin":"B0089KFIDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-830934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0089KFIDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0089KFIDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
